WEBVTT

00:03:28.076 --> 00:03:30.636
every department had to get active,

00:03:30.676 --> 00:03:32.636
figure out measures

00:03:32.676 --> 00:03:35.396
and finding out how to implement them.

00:03:35.436 --> 00:03:38.236
So second lesson, be ambitious.

00:03:38.276 --> 00:03:42.236
A target measured in years, not decades,

00:03:42.276 --> 00:03:45.796
provides no excuse for inaction.

00:03:47.676 --> 00:03:49.596
In my experience,

00:03:49.636 --> 00:03:53.236
the key challenges
of achieving climate targets

00:03:53.276 --> 00:03:56.996
is that the division of responsibility
we see on global,

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:58.916
national and local levels.

00:03:59.436 --> 00:04:01.316
In the city, the same is true.